{"unit_id":"pany0593__dsh-ui-notifications#feature-1","repo":"pany0593/dsh-ui-notifications","commit":"5c59129423fa101e712724796f7619c1f9f30be5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-system-notifications 的功能「回合结束提醒」：会话运行状态从运行变为停止时生成提醒。仅当网页在后台且已启用并获浏览器授权时弹出通知，点击后打开对应会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/notifications.ts:35-47","src/client/index.ts:117-127"]}
