{"unit_id":"pany0593__dsh-ui-notifications#feature-4","repo":"pany0593/dsh-ui-notifications","commit":"5c59129423fa101e712724796f7619c1f9f30be5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-system-notifications 的功能「忽略子代理」：插件投影会话列表时过滤 origin 为 subagent 的行，因此内部编排活动不会触发回合结束或待处理交互提醒。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:84-97"]}
